1735
01:55:12,581 --> 01:55:15,071
And everything turns on its head.
ແລະທຸກຢ່າງຫັນໄປສູ່ຫົວຂອງມັນ.

1736
01:55:15,071 --> 01:55:19,423
Now he realizes that Marta
